sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as Inbox tab
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant R as Triage router
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant Mem as Memory store
    participant T as Trace file
    participant M as Inbox manager

    UI->>API: PATCH /api/emails/{id} {category, reason}
    API->>DB: get email
    API->>R: triage_new_email(message, source=user), rule manual
    R->>R: check_source -> save (no pre_triage, no model)
    R->>DB: save
    R->>Mem: remember: an ignore with a sender-stable reason goes on the ignore list
    R->>T: manual_user_input line
    alt auto_schedule or auto_draft
        R->>M: handle(message)
    end
    API-->>UI: updated email
